msgstr "Istruzione <code>close</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/close.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Close a file opened previously with <code><a cbot|open>open</a></code>. This"
" is a method of the <code><a cbot|file>file</a></code> class; therefore you "
"cannot write  <code>close()</code> but only <code>handle.close()</code>:"
msgstr ""
"Chiude un file aperto con <code><a cbot|open>open</a></code>. È un metodo "
"della classe <code><a cbot|file>file</a></code>: devi quindi scrivere "
"<code>handle.close()</code>, non <code>close()</code>:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/close.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "\thandle.close();"
msgstr "\thandle.close();"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/close.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|file>file</a></code>, <code><a cbot|open>open</a></code>, <code><a cbot|readln>readln</a></code>, <code><a cbot|writeln>writeln</a></code> and <code><a cbot|eof>eof</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|file>file</a></code>, <code><a cbot|open>open</a></code>, <code><a cbot|readln>readln</a></code>, <code><a cbot|writeln>writeln</a></code> e <code><a cbot|eof>eof</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/cond.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conditions"
msgstr "Condizioni"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/expr.txt:117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code>a == b  </code><code>a</code> equals <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a != b  </code><code>a</code> is different from <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a <  b  </code><code>a</code> smaller than <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a <= b  </code><code>a</code> smaller than or equal to <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a >  b  </code><code>a</code> greater than <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a >= b  </code><code>a</code> greater than or equal to <code>b</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code>a == b  </code><code>a</code> è uguale a <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a != b  </code><code>a</code> è diverso da <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a <  b  </code><code>a</code> è minore di <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a <= b  </code><code>a</code> è minore o uguale a <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a >  b  </code><code>a</code> è maggiore di <code>b</code>\n"
"<code>a >= b  </code><code>a</code> è maggiore o uguale a <code>b</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/expr.txt:125
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code>12 == 12  </code>returns true\n"
"<code>45 != 47  </code>returns true \n"
"<code>99 == 98  </code>returns false\n"
"<code>12 <  -1  </code>returns false\n"
"<code>12 >= 10  </code>returns true \n"
"<code>12 >= 12  </code>returns true "
msgstr ""
"<code>12 == 12  </code>restituisce true\n"
"<code>45 != 47  </code>restituisce true \n"
"<code>99 == 98  </code>restituisce false\n"
"<code>12 <  -1  </code>restituisce false\n"
"<code>12 >= 10  </code>restituisce true \n"
"<code>12 >= 12  </code>restituisce true "

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/expr.txt:133
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be careful not to confuse the equality comparison <code>==</code> with the "
"assignment of a <a cbot|var>variable</a> <code>=</code>."
msgstr ""
"Non confondere il confronto di uguaglianza <code>==</code> con "
"l’assegnazione di una <a cbot|var>variabile</a> <code>=</code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/expr.txt:135
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code>a == b</code> is an expression that compares <code>a</code> with <code>b</code>.\n"
"<code>a = b</code> is an expression that copies the value of <code>b</code> into <code>a</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code>a == b</code> confronta <code>a</code> con <code>b</code>.\n"
"<code>a = b</code> copia il valore di <code>b</code> in <code>a</code>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/continue.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>continue</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>continue</code>"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/continue.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>while ( condition )\n"
"{\n"
"\tcontinue;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"<c/>while ( condition )\n"
"{\n"
"\tcontinue;\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/continue.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With this instruction, you can jump over the rest of instructions in the "
"<code><a cbot|bloc>bloc</a></code> of a <code><a cbot|while>while</a></code>"
" or <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> loop: The execution will resume at the "
"beginning of the bloc, the next time the loop is repeated."
msgstr ""
"Questa istruzione salta le istruzioni rimanenti nel <code><a "
"cbot|bloc>bloc</a></code> di un ciclo <code><a cbot|while>while</a></code> o"
" <code><a cbot|for>for</a></code>. L’esecuzione riprende dall’inizio del "
"blocco all’iterazione successiva."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/continue.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>int i = 0;\n"
"while ( i < 5 )\n"
"{\n"
"\ti = i+1;\n"
"\tif ( i == 3 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tcontinue;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t<n/>Instructions ...<c/>\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"<c/>int i = 0;\n"
"while ( i < 5 )\n"
"{\n"
"\ti = i+1;\n"
"\tif ( i == 3 )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tcontinue;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t<n/>Instructions ...<c/>\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/continue.txt:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instructions will only be executed for the values of <code>i</code> 1, "
"2, 4 and 5."
msgstr ""
"Le istruzioni vengono eseguite soltanto per i valori 1, 2, 4 e 5 di "
"<code>i</code>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/deletef.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>deletefile</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>deletefile</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/deletef.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The deletefile instruction deletes an existing file in the files/ folder. "
msgstr ""
"L’istruzione deletefile elimina un file esistente nella cartella files/. "

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/deletef.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Files can only be deleted in the files/ folder which is located in the "
"folder inside Colobot save directory. You cannot not delete files that are "
"located elsewhere than in the files/ folder."
msgstr ""
"Puoi eliminare soltanto file nella cartella files/ interna alla cartella dei"
" salvataggi di Colobot, non file situati altrove."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/deletef.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "<c/>deletefile ( filename );<n/>"
msgstr "<c/>deletefile ( filename );<n/>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>deleteinfo</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>deleteinfo</code>"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "<c/>deleteinfo ( name, power );<n/>"
msgstr "<c/>deleteinfo ( name, power );<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Delete an existing information in the closest <a object|exchange>information"
" exchange post</a>."
msgstr ""
"Elimina un dato esistente nel <a object|exchange>centro di scambio dati</a> "
"più vicino."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:7 ../E/receive.txt:7 ../E/send.txt:7 ../E/testinfo.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "name: <code>string</code>"
msgstr "name: <code>string</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name of the information to be deleted. This name is a string: it must be "
"written in quotation marks \"\"."
msgstr ""
"Nome del dato da eliminare. È una stringa e deve essere racchiusa tra "
"virgolette \"\"."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:10 ../E/receive.txt:10 ../E/send.txt:14
#: ../E/testinfo.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "power: <code>float</code>"
msgstr "power: <code>float</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Power of the transmitter, which corresponds to the maximal distance between "
"the sender and the exchange post. If the distance is longer, the information"
" won't be deleted. Default value is 10 metres."
msgstr ""
"Potenza del trasmettitore, corrispondente alla distanza massima dal centro "
"di scambio dati. Se la distanza è superiore, il dato non viene eliminato. Il"
" valore predefinito è 10 metri."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/delinfo.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|receive>receive</a></code>, <code><a cbot|send>send</a></code> and <code><a cbot|testinfo>testinfo</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|receive>receive</a></code>, <code><a cbot|send>send</a></code> e <code><a cbot|testinfo>testinfo</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/direct.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>direction</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>direction</code>"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/direct.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "<c/>direction ( pos );<n/>"
msgstr "<c/>direction ( pos );<n/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/direct.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Calculates the rotation that a robot must perform in order to point towards "
"a given position. "
msgstr ""
"Calcola la rotazione necessaria a orientare il robot verso una posizione. "

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/direct.txt:7 ../E/goto.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "pos: <code><a cbot|point>point</a></code>"
msgstr "pos: <code><a cbot|point>point</a></code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/direct.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Position towards which the robot must point."
msgstr "Posizione verso cui orientare il robot."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/acos.txt:8 ../E/asin.txt:8 ../E/atan.txt:8 ../E/atan2.txt:13
#: ../E/ceil.txt:9 ../E/cos.txt:8 ../E/direct.txt:10 ../E/dist.txt:26
#: ../E/dist2d.txt:10 ../E/flatgrnd.txt:13 ../E/floor.txt:9 ../E/pow.txt:11
#: ../E/rand.txt:5 ../E/receive.txt:13 ../E/round.txt:9 ../E/sin.txt:8
#: ../E/sqrt.txt:8 ../E/tan.txt:8 ../E/topo.txt:10 ../E/trunc.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Return value: <code><a cbot|float>float</a></code>"
msgstr "Valore restituito: <code><a cbot|float>float</a></code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/direct.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Angle of the rotation that must be performed. -90 means f. ex. a rotation of"
" 90 degrees to the right. "
msgstr ""
"Angolo della rotazione richiesta. Per esempio, -90 indica una rotazione di "
"90 gradi a destra. "

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/dist.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>distance</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>distance</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/dist.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With the instruction <code>distance( , )</code> you can calculate the "
"distance between two positions."
msgstr ""
"L’istruzione <code>distance( , )</code> calcola la distanza fra due "
"posizioni."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/build.txt:4 ../E/buildingenabled.txt:4 ../E/canbuild.txt:4
#: ../E/dist.txt:4 ../E/drop.txt:4 ../E/fire.txt:4 ../E/function.txt:16
#: ../E/goto.txt:4 ../E/grab.txt:4 ../E/if.txt:4 ../E/motor.txt:4
#: ../E/move.txt:4 ../E/radar.txt:4 ../E/switch.txt:4 ../E/turn.txt:4
#: ../E/wait.txt:4 ../E/while.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic use"
msgstr "Uso di base"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/dist.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you write <code>position</code> alone, this gives you the position of the"
" bot that executes the program. If you write the name of a variable followed"
" by <code>.position</code>, this gives you the position of the object "
"described in the variable."
msgstr ""
"Scrivere soltanto <code>position</code> restituisce la posizione del robot "
"che esegue il programma. Il nome di una variabile seguito da "
"<code>.position</code> restituisce invece la posizione dell’oggetto "
"descritto dalla variabile."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/dist.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here is a program that moves forward, covering exactly the distance between "
"the bot and the closest ant:"
msgstr ""
"Questo programma avanza esattamente della distanza fra il robot e la formica"
" più vicina:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/dist.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(AlienAnt);\n"
"\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(distance(position, item.position));"
msgstr ""
"\titem = <a cbot|radar>radar</a>(AlienAnt);\n"
"\t<a cbot|move>move</a>(distance(position, item.position));"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/dist.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is of course pure suicide. Better to stop 40 meters before, in order to"
" be at shooting range:"
msgstr ""
"Naturalmente è un suicidio. Meglio fermarsi 40 metri prima, a distanza di "
"tiro:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/dist.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\titem = radar(AlienAnt);\n"
"\tmove(distance(position, item.position) - 40);"
msgstr ""
"\titem = radar(AlienAnt);\n"
"\tmove(distance(position, item.position) - 40);"

#. type: \b; header, \t; header
#: ../E/build.txt:11 ../E/buildingenabled.txt:12 ../E/canbuild.txt:12
