#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/isbusy.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Any building which can take some action (e.g. <a "
"cbot|convert>Converter</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Un edificio capace di svolgere un’azione, per esempio un <a "
"cbot|convert>convertitore</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/isbusy.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><format const>true</format></code> if the object is doing something (e.g. converting)\n"
"<code><format const>false</format></code> if the object is not doing anything"
msgstr ""
"<code><format const>true</format></code> se l’oggetto sta svolgendo un’attività (per esempio una conversione)\n"
"<code><format const>false</format></code> se non sta facendo nulla"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instruction <code>canbuild</code>"
msgstr "Istruzione <code>canbuild</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It helps to prevent errors in programs using the <c/><a "
"cbot|build>build();</a><n/> instruction. Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"Aiuta a evitare errori nei programmi che usano <c/><a "
"cbot|build>build();</a><n/>. Esempio:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" <a cbot|if>if</a> (canbuild(<a object|factory>BotFactory</a>))\n"
" {\n"
" \tbuild(<a object|factory>BotFactory</a>);\n"
" }"
msgstr ""
" <a cbot|if>if</a> (canbuild(<a object|factory>BotFactory</a>))\n"
" {\n"
" \tbuild(<a object|factory>BotFactory</a>);\n"
" }"

