#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Classes can be only <a cbot|public>public</a>. This means that they can be "
"used by all bots in a mission."
msgstr ""
"Le classi possono essere solo <a cbot|public>public</a>, quindi sono "
"utilizzabili da tutti i robot della missione."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/class.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Class Members"
msgstr "Membri della classe"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Class members are fields (<a cbot|var>variables</a>) and methods (<a "
"cbot|function>functions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"I membri sono campi (<a cbot|var>variabili</a>) e metodi (<a "
"cbot|function>funzioni</a>)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, the following class dubbed <code>MyClass</code> contains 4 "
"fields (<code>a</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>x</code> and <code>s</code>) "
"and one method (<code>MyFunction</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Per esempio, <code>MyClass</code> contiene 4 campi (<code>a</code>, "
"<code>b</code>, <code>x</code> e <code>s</code>) e un metodo "
"(<code>MyFunction</code>)."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/class.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tint     a, b;\n"
"\tfloat   x = 3.33;\n"
"\tstring  s = \"hello\";\n"
"\tfloat   MyFunction(float value)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn (value * x) - 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tint     a, b;\n"
"\tfloat   x = 3.33;\n"
"\tstring  s = \"hello\";\n"
"\tfloat   MyFunction(float value)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn (value * x) - 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/class.txt:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Member Initialization"
msgstr "Inizializzazione dei membri"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:<c/>"
msgstr "Esempio:<c/>"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/class.txt:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tint  a, b;\n"
"\tvoid MyClass()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\ta = 2;  b = 3;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvoid MyClass(int a, int b)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tthis.a = a;  this.b = b;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tint  a, b;\n"
"\tvoid MyClass()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\ta = 2;  b = 3;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvoid MyClass(int a, int b)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tthis.a = a;  this.b = b;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As the names of the parameters of the second constructor are the same as the"
" names of the two members <code>a</code> and <code>b</code>, we must use the"
" <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code> <a cbot|pointer>reference</a> to avoid "
"confusion with the parameters' names."
msgstr ""
"I parametri del secondo costruttore hanno gli stessi nomi dei membri "
"<code>a</code> e <code>b</code>. Usa il <a cbot|pointer>riferimento</a> "
"<code><a cbot|this>this</a></code> per distinguerli."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/class.txt:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Object Creation"
msgstr "Creazione degli oggetti"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can create objects of type <code>YourClass</code> using the <code><a "
"cbot|new>new</a></code> keyword. Example:"
msgstr ""
"Puoi creare oggetti di tipo <code>YourClass</code> con <code><a "
"cbot|new>new</a></code>. Esempio:"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/class.txt:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Object Destruction"
msgstr "Distruzione degli oggetti"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/class.txt:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Passing Objects to Functions"
msgstr "Passare oggetti alle funzioni"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Objects in CBOT are passed by <a cbot|pointer>reference</a>. This means that"
" when an object is passed to a <a cbot|function>function</a>, the function "
"receives a copy of a pointer to the instance, not a copy of the object, so "
"any modifications on the object will be visible outside of the function."
msgstr ""
"In CBOT gli oggetti sono passati per <a cbot|pointer>riferimento</a>. La <a "
"cbot|function>funzione</a> riceve una copia del riferimento all’istanza, non"
" dell’oggetto: le modifiche sono quindi visibili anche all’esterno."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/class.txt:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inheritance"
msgstr "Ereditarietà"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A class can inherit public and protected members of another class by using "
"the <code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code> keyword."
msgstr ""
"Una classe può ereditare i membri pubblici e protetti di un’altra con "
"<code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This keyword allows you to create a class definition by using the following "
"syntax:"
msgstr "Questa parola chiave definisce una classe con la sintassi seguente:"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/class.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "All Classes Are Public"
msgstr "Tutte le classi sono pubbliche"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/class.txt:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Class Members Modifiers"
msgstr "Modificatori dei membri"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/class.txt:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>"
msgstr "Usare <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/class.txt:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tMyClass object1();       // Call default constructor (without parameters)\n"
"\tMyClass object2(4, 5);   // Call constructor with two int parameters\n"
"\tMyClass object3;         // No constructor called, object3 == null\n"
"\tobject3 = new MyClass(); // We call constructor now, object3 != null\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tMyClass object1();       // Call default constructor (without parameters)\n"
"\tMyClass object2(4, 5);   // Call constructor with two int parameters\n"
"\tMyClass object3;         // No constructor called, object3 == null\n"
"\tobject3 = new MyClass(); // We call constructor now, object3 != null\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also define a destructor. This must be a <code><a "
"cbot|void>void</a></code> fonction without parameters, which has the same "
"name as the class but prefixed with the <code>~</code> character. The "
"destructor is called automatically as soon as the class instance is no more "
"referenced by anyone. Example:"
msgstr ""
"Puoi definire un distruttore: una funzione <code><a "
"cbot|void>void</a></code> senza parametri, con il nome della classe "
"preceduto da <code>~</code>. Viene chiamato automaticamente quando nessuno "
"fa più riferimento all’istanza. Esempio:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/class.txt:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tstatic private int counter = 0; // instance counter\n"
"\tvoid  MyClass( )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tcounter++;  // one instance more\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvoid ~MyClass( )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tcounter--;  // one instance less\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\t                   // counter == 0\n"
"\tMyClass item1( );  // counter == 1\n"
"\tMyClass item2( );  // counter == 2\n"
"\titem1 = null;      // counter == 1\n"
"}\n"
"// counter == 0"
msgstr ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tstatic private int counter = 0; // instance counter\n"
"\tvoid  MyClass( )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tcounter++;  // one instance more\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvoid ~MyClass( )\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tcounter--;  // one instance less\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\t                   // counter == 0\n"
"\tMyClass item1( );  // counter == 1\n"
"\tMyClass item2( );  // counter == 2\n"
"\titem1 = null;      // counter == 1\n"
"}\n"
"// counter == 0"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/class.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accessing Class Members"
msgstr "Accedere ai membri"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Class members can be accessed outside of the class definition by using the "
"<code>.</code> operator. Example:"
msgstr ""
"Dall’esterno della classe puoi accedere ai membri con l’operatore "
"<code>.</code>. Esempio:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Class members are <a cbot|public>public</a> by default, which means that "
"they are accessible outside of the class definition. They can also be "
"declared as <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code> or <code><a "
"cbot|protected>protected</a></code>. Such members can only be accessed "
"inside of the class definition."
msgstr ""
"I membri sono <a cbot|public>public</a> per impostazione predefinita, quindi"
" accessibili dall’esterno. Puoi dichiararli <code><a "
"cbot|private>private</a></code> o <code><a "
"cbot|protected>protected</a></code> per limitarne l’accesso all’interno "
"delle definizioni di classe."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Fields and methods can also be declared as <code><a "
"cbot|static>static</a></code>. Methods can be additionaly declared as "
"<code><a cbot|synchro>synchronized</a></code>."
msgstr ""
"Campi e metodi possono essere <code><a cbot|static>static</a></code>. I "
"metodi possono anche essere <code><a cbot|synchro>synchronized</a></code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another way of initiliazing fields is by defining a constructor which is a "
"special method having the same name as the class. This method will be called"
" automatically at <a cbot|new>creation</a> time of a class instance. "
"Constructors can be <a cbot|function>overloaded</a>."
msgstr ""
"Un altro modo di inizializzare i campi è definire un costruttore, un metodo "
"speciale con lo stesso nome della classe. Viene chiamato alla <a "
"cbot|new>creazione</a> dell’istanza. I costruttori possono essere <a "
"cbot|function>sovraccaricati</a>."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/class.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tint myField = 0;\n"
"\tint MyFunction()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn myField * 2;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tMyClass myObject();\n"
"\tmyObject.myField = 10;\n"
"\tmessage(myObject.MyFunction()); // 20\n"
"\tMyClass mySecondObject();\n"
"\tmySecondObject.myField = myObject.myField - 2;\n"
"\tmessage(mySecondObject.MyFunction()); // 16\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class MyClass\n"
"{\n"
"\tint myField = 0;\n"
"\tint MyFunction()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn myField * 2;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tMyClass myObject();\n"
"\tmyObject.myField = 10;\n"
"\tmessage(myObject.MyFunction()); // 20\n"
"\tMyClass mySecondObject();\n"
"\tmySecondObject.myField = myObject.myField - 2;\n"
"\tmessage(mySecondObject.MyFunction()); // 16\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:121
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>, <code><a cbot|static>static</a></code>, <code><a cbot|synchro>synchronized</a></code>, <code><a cbot|new>new</a></code>, <code><a cbot|pointer>reference</a></code>, <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>, <code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>, <code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>, <code><a cbot|static>static</a></code>, <code><a cbot|synchro>synchronized</a></code>, <code><a cbot|new>new</a></code>, <code><a cbot|pointer>reference</a></code>, <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>, <code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>, <code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/protected.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keyword <code>protected</code>"
msgstr "Parola chiave <code>protected</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/protected.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is an access modifier for <a cbot|class>class</a> members. Protected "
"class members can be accessed in a child class, but they can't be accessed "
"outside of classes definitions being part of the same inheritance tree (see "
"the <code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code> keyword)."
msgstr ""
"Modificatore di accesso dei membri di <a cbot|class>classe</a>. I membri "
"protetti sono accessibili nelle classi derivate, ma non dall’esterno delle "
"definizioni appartenenti alla stessa gerarchia (vedi <code><a "
"cbot|extends>extends</a></code>)."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/protected.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tprotected int field = 0;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid Print()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(field);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.Print(); // 0\n"
"\t//child.field = 1; // Error!\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tprotected int field = 0;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid Print()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(field);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.Print(); // 0\n"
"\t//child.field = 1; // Error!\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/private.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is an access modifier for <a cbot|class>class</a> members. Private "
"members are not accessible outside of the class definition."
msgstr ""
"Modificatore di accesso dei membri di <a cbot|class>classe</a>. I membri "
"privati non sono accessibili dall’esterno della definizione."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/private.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/public.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code>public</code> is also an access modifier for <a cbot|class>class</a> "
"members, which is the default one. Public members can be accessed from "
"outside of the class definition."
msgstr ""
"<code>public</code> è il modificatore predefinito dei membri di <a "
"cbot|class>classe</a>: li rende accessibili dall’esterno."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/public.txt:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>, <code><a cbot|function>functions</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>, <code><a cbot|function>functions</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/protected.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|extends>extends</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/super.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keyword <code>super</code>"
msgstr "Parola chiave <code>super</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/super.txt:46
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/this.txt:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/extends.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keyword <code>extends</code>"
msgstr "Parola chiave <code>extends</code>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/extends.txt:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inherited Members"
msgstr "Membri ereditati"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Only <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code> and <code><a "
"cbot|protected>protected</a></code> members are inherited. <code><a "
"cbot|private>private</a></code> members are directly inaccessible even for a"
" child, although they can be accessed indirectly through inherited methods."
msgstr ""
"Vengono ereditati solo i membri <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code> e "
"<code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>. Quelli <code><a "
"cbot|private>private</a></code> restano direttamente inaccessibili anche "
"alla classe derivata, ma possono essere raggiunti indirettamente tramite "
"metodi ereditati."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Constructors and destructors are not inherited, however, they can be "
"overriden."
msgstr ""
"Costruttori e distruttori non vengono ereditati, ma possono essere "
"ridefiniti."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/extends.txt:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Method Overriding"
msgstr "Ridefinizione dei metodi"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Inherited methods can be overriden (redefined) in the child class "
"definition. Example:"
msgstr "Puoi ridefinire i metodi ereditati nella classe derivata. Esempio:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/extends.txt:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.foo(); // Will show \"bar\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.foo(); // Will show \"bar\"\n"
"}"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/extends.txt:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Polymorphism"
msgstr "Polimorfismo"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|pointer>Reference</a></code> of type Parent can point to an "
"object of type Child. However, such a pointer can't be used to access a "
"child member. In order to access a child member, it must be assured that the"
" Parent reference really points to a Child object. If that's the case, it "
"can be safely copied to a pointer of type Child, which has access to the "
"child members."
msgstr ""
"Un <code><a cbot|pointer>Reference</a></code> di tipo Parent può indicare un"
" oggetto Child, ma non accedere ai membri specifici di Child. Dopo aver "
"verificato che indichi davvero un Child, puoi copiarlo in un riferimento "
"Child per accedere a quei membri."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/extends.txt:67
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvoid bar()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tParent people[2];\n"
"\tpeople[0] = new Parent();\n"
"\tpeople[1] = new Child();\n"
"\tfor (int i = 0; i < 2; ++i)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tpeople[i].foo();\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t//people[1].bar(); // Error\n"
"\tChild child = people[1];\n"
"\tchild.bar(); // OK\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvoid bar()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tParent people[2];\n"
"\tpeople[0] = new Parent();\n"
"\tpeople[1] = new Child();\n"
"\tfor (int i = 0; i < 2; ++i)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tpeople[i].foo();\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t//people[1].bar(); // Error\n"
"\tChild child = people[1];\n"
"\tchild.bar(); // OK\n"
"}"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/extends.txt:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiple Inheritance"
msgstr "Ereditarietà multipla"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A child cannot have multiple parents, however, a parent can have many "
"children."
msgstr ""
"Una classe derivata non può avere più classi base; una classe base può "
"invece avere molte derivate."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>, <code><a cbot|new>new</a></code>, <code><a cbot|pointer>reference</a></code>, <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>, <code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|class>class</a></code>, <code><a cbot|public>public</a></code>, <code><a cbot|private>private</a></code>, <code><a cbot|protected>protected</a></code>, <code><a cbot|new>new</a></code>, <code><a cbot|pointer>reference</a></code>, <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>, <code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/super.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This keyword is similar to <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>, however, it "
"grants access to methods from the parent class (see the <code><a "
"cbot|extends>extends</a></code> keyword), which is especially useful for "
"method overriding."
msgstr ""
"Questa parola chiave è simile a <code><a cbot|this>this</a></code>, ma "
"accede ai metodi della classe base (vedi <code><a "
"cbot|extends>extends</a></code>), utile soprattutto quando un metodo è "
"ridefinito."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/super.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tprotected int field;\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Parent()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tfield = 0;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Print()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"Parent's field: \" + field);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate int childsField;\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Child()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tsuper.Parent();\n"
"\t\tchildsField = field + 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Print()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tsuper.Print();\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"Child's field: \" + childsField);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.Print(); // Will show both 0 and 1\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tprotected int field;\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Parent()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tfield = 0;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Print()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"Parent's field: \" + field);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate int childsField;\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Child()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tsuper.Parent();\n"
"\t\tchildsField = field + 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\t\n"
"\tvoid Print()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tsuper.Print();\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"Child's field: \" + childsField);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.Print(); // Will show both 0 and 1\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This keyword is used in a <code><a cbot|class>class</a></code> definition "
"when we want the class to inherit members from another class. The class "
"which is extended we usually call a parent or base, the extending class we "
"call a child."
msgstr ""
"Si usa nella definizione di una <code><a cbot|class>class</a></code> per "
"ereditarne i membri da un’altra. La classe estesa è detta base o genitrice, "
"quella che la estende derivata o figlia."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/extends.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid bar()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.foo(); // Will show \"foo\"\n"
"\tchild.bar(); // Will show \"bar\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"public class Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid foo()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"foo\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public class Child extends Parent\n"
"{\n"
"\tvoid bar()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tmessage(\"bar\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"extern void object::Test()\n"
"{\n"
"\tChild child();\n"
"\tchild.foo(); // Will show \"foo\"\n"
"\tchild.bar(); // Will show \"bar\"\n"
"}"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/extends.txt:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A parent's method can be called inside an overriden method by using the "
"<code><a cbot|super>super</a></code> keyword."
msgstr ""
"Dentro un metodo ridefinito puoi chiamare quello della classe base con "
"<code><a cbot|super>super</a></code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/class.txt:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As shown in the previous example, the class members can be initialized in "
"the class definition (<c/>int x = 3.33;<n/>)."
msgstr ""
"Come nell’esempio precedente, i membri possono essere inizializzati nella "
"definizione della classe (<c/>int x = 3.33;<n/>)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/open.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code>\"r\"</code> mode: open for reading.\n"
"<code>\"w\"</code> mode: open for writing.\n"
"<code>\"a\"</code> mode: open for appending."
msgstr ""
"Modalità <code>\"r\"</code>: lettura.\n"
"Modalità <code>\"w\"</code>: scrittura.\n"
"Modalità <code>\"a\"</code>: aggiunta in fondo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/openfile.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>openfile();<n/> opens an text file in the files/ folder. This is not a "
"method of the <code><a cbot|file>file</a></code> class but openfile returns "
"a <a cbot|pointer>reference</a> to a new instance of the file class. You "
"must supply two parameters, the filename and the opening mode."
msgstr ""
"<c/>openfile();<n/> apre un file di testo nella cartella files/. Non è un "
"metodo della classe <code><a cbot|file>file</a></code>: restituisce un <a "
"cbot|pointer>riferimento</a> a una nuova istanza di file. Richiede due "
"parametri: nome del file e modalità di apertura."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/openfile.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code>\"r\"</code> mode: open for reading.\n"
"<code>\"w\"</code> mode: open for writing.\n"
"<code>\"w\"</code> mode: open for appending."
msgstr ""
"Modalità <code>\"r\"</code>: lettura.\n"
"Modalità <code>\"w\"</code>: scrittura.\n"
"Modalità <code>\"w\"</code>: aggiunta in fondo."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/function.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Nothing but a name can be changed in the main function. The keyword <code><a"
" cbot|extern>extern</a></code> distinguishes the main function from others."
msgstr ""
"Nella funzione principale puoi cambiare solo il nome. <code><a "
"cbot|extern>extern</a></code> la distingue dalle altre."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/function.txt:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Functions"
msgstr "Funzioni pubbliche"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/function.txt:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Parameters"
msgstr "Parametri predefiniti"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/function.txt:130
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Last function parameters can have default values that can be omitted when "
"calling."
msgstr ""
"Gli ultimi parametri possono avere valori predefiniti e venire omessi nella "
"chiamata."

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/function.txt:132
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"float Add(float a = 0.0, float b = 0.0)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Somewhere in the main program...\n"
"Add(); // Will return 0.0\n"
"Add(2.0); // Will return 2.0\n"
"Add(2.0, 3.0); // Will return 5.0\n"
"// ..."
msgstr ""
"float Add(float a = 0.0, float b = 0.0)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Somewhere in the main program...\n"
"Add(); // Will return 0.0\n"
"Add(2.0); // Will return 2.0\n"
"Add(2.0, 3.0); // Will return 5.0\n"
"// ..."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/function.txt:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default Parameters and Overloading"
msgstr "Parametri predefiniti e sovraccarico"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/function.txt:145
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Functions with default parameters still can be overloaded, one must only "
"ensure that function calls are not ambiguous. For example, consider the "
"following code:"
msgstr ""
"Puoi sovraccaricare funzioni con parametri predefiniti, purché le chiamate "
"non siano ambigue. Per esempio:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../E/function.txt:147
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"float Add(float a = 0.0, float b = 0.0)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"string Add(string a = \"\", string b = \"\")\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Somewhere in the main program...\n"
"Add(); // Compilation error: ambiguous call\n"
"Add(\"\"); // Ok\n"
"Add(0.0); // Ok\n"
"// ..."
msgstr ""
"float Add(float a = 0.0, float b = 0.0)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"string Add(string a = \"\", string b = \"\")\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn a + b;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Somewhere in the main program...\n"
"Add(); // Compilation error: ambiguous call\n"
"Add(\"\"); // Ok\n"
"Add(0.0); // Ok\n"
"// ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/function.txt:163
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that in the above example overloading causes the first default "
"parameter to be useless as caller needs to pass it anyway in order to "
"distinguish the two functions."
msgstr ""
"Qui il sovraccarico rende inutile il primo parametro predefinito: il "
"chiamante deve comunque specificarlo per distinguere le due funzioni."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/category.txt:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<button 192/>   <code><a object|botbr>WheeledBuilder</a>         </code>Wheeled Builder\n"
"<button 193/>   <code><a object|botbc>TrackedBuilder</a>         </code>Tracked Builder\n"
"<button 194/>   <code><a object|botbj>WingedBuilder</a>          </code>Winged Builder\n"
"<button 195/>   <code><a object|botbs>LeggedBuilder</a>          </code>Legged Builder"
msgstr ""
"<button 192/>   <code><a object|botbr>WheeledBuilder</a>         </code>Robot costruttore su ruote\n"
"<button 193/>   <code><a object|botbc>TrackedBuilder</a>         </code>Robot costruttore cingolato\n"
"<button 194/>   <code><a object|botbj>WingedBuilder</a>          </code>Robot costruttore volante\n"
"<button 195/>   <code><a object|botbs>LeggedBuilder</a>          </code>Robot costruttore a zampe"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/build.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <c/>build();<n/> instructs the bot to build a building of a "
"given <a cbot|category>category</a>."
msgstr ""
"L’istruzione <c/>build();<n/> costruisce un edificio della <a "
"cbot|category>categoria</a> indicata."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/build.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here is a program that looks for the nearest <a object|titan>titanium "
"cube</a>, approaches it, and builds a <a object|factory>bot factory</a>."
msgstr ""
"Questo programma cerca il <a object|titan>cubo di titanio</a> più vicino, si"
" avvicina e costruisce una <a object|factory>fabbrica di robot</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/build.txt:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|canbuild>canbuild</a></code>, <code><a cbot|buildingenabled>buildingenabled</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|canbuild>canbuild</a></code>, <code><a cbot|buildingenabled>buildingenabled</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/buildingenabled.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <c/>buildingenabled();<n/> lets you know if a building of a "
"given <a cbot|category>category</a> can be built during current mission."
msgstr ""
"L’istruzione <c/>buildingenabled();<n/> verifica se un edificio della <a "
"cbot|category>categoria</a> indicata è costruibile nella missione."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/buildingenabled.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|build>build</a></code>, <code><a cbot|canbuild>canbuild</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|build>build</a></code>, <code><a cbot|canbuild>canbuild</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <c/>canbuild();<n/> lets you know if <a "
"object|botbr>Builders</a>, <a object|human>Me</a> or <a "
"object|human>Tech</a> can build a building of a given <a "
"cbot|category>category</a>."
msgstr ""
"L’istruzione <c/>canbuild();<n/> verifica se i <a object|botbr>robot "
"costruttori</a>, l’<a object|human>astronauta</a> o il <a "
"object|human>tecnico</a> possono costruire un edificio della <a "
"cbot|category>categoria</a> indicata."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/canbuild.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|build>build</a></code>, <code><a cbot|buildingenabled>buildingenabled</a></code>.\n"
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a cbot|category>categories</a>."
